
# Peanut Butter and Jelly Sandwich

## Assumptions 
- The robot is in a kitchen. Bread, peanut butter, jelly, a butter knife, and a plate are on the counter. The bread bag and both jars are closed.

## Steps
1. Take two slices of bread from the bread bag and place them flat on the plate.
2. Use the butter knife to spread peanut butter across the top of one slice of bread.
3. Use the butter knife to spread jelly across the top of the other slice of bread.
4. Place the jelly-covered side of the second slice directly on top of the peanut butter-covered side.
5. Place the finished sandwich in the center of the plate.

## Done When
- The sandwich is done when the peanut butter and jelly are between the two slices of bread and the sandwich is on the plate.